{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BraidsAndKnots.LagrangeResolventTransform","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BraidsAndKnots.LagrangeResolventTransform","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Complex.Exponential","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fin.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Fin","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.lagrange_resolvent_diagonal_action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.lagrange_resolvent_diagonal_action","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L85-L105","doc":"Part (2): The cyclic permutation acts diagonally on Lagrange resolvents.\nσ(w_k) = ζ^{-k} · w_k for all k.\nProof: case-split on k ∈ {0,1,2,3,4}, expand the Fin 5 sums,\nreduce powers of ζ modulo 5 using ζ^5 = 1, and close by ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.lagrange_resolvent_w0_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.lagrange_resolvent_w0_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L74-L83","doc":"Part (1): w_0 = 0 from the constraint Σx_i = 0.\nAt k=0, ζ^0 = 1, so w_0 = (1/√5) Σ x_j = 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.cyclicPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.cyclicPerm","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L70-L72","doc":"The cyclic permutation σ: x_j ↦ x_{j+1 mod 5}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.lagrangeResolvent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.lagrangeResolvent","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L66-L68","doc":"The Lagrange resolvent (DFT) of coordinates on the Bring surface. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.ζ_pow_four_eq_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.ζ_pow_four_eq_inv","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L43-L46","doc":"ζ^4 = ζ⁻¹, since ζ^4 · ζ = ζ^5 = 1 = ζ⁻¹ · ζ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.ζ_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.ζ_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L36-L41","doc":"ζ is nonzero (since ζ^5 = 1 ≠ 0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.ζ_pow_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.ζ_pow_five","kind":"theorem","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L25-L34","doc":"ζ is a primitive 5th root of unity: ζ^5 = 1.\nSince ζ = exp(2πi/5), we have ζ^5 = exp(5 · 2πi/5) = exp(2πi) = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.ζ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.ζ","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/lagrange-resolvent-transform.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0}]}